3
00:00:08.168 --> 00:00:10.829
I have light skin.

4
00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:13.810
He has dark skin.

5
00:00:13.811 --> 00:00:17.512
We have different eye colors.

6
00:00:17.513 --> 00:00:20.433
I have green eyes.

7
00:00:20.434 --> 00:00:23.031
He has brown eyes.

8
00:00:23.032 --> 00:00:25.681
She has blue eyes.

9
00:00:25.682 --> 00:00:28.447
